Q: Search for a column value in a 2d array and return the first level key of the qualifying row A: <p>This is because <code>array_column()</code> doesn't keep your keys. So you first need to <a href="http://php.net/manual/en/function.array-combine.php" rel="nofollow"><code>array_combine()</code></a> the keys with the array from <code>array_column()</code>, e.g.</p>

<pre><code>$location_key = array_search(1, <b>array_combine(array_keys($locations),</b> array_column($locations, 'main')<b>)</b>);
</code></pre>
